#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:33
msgid "Quality, Not Hype."
msgstr "Quality, Not Hype."

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:34
msgid "Know your socks. See the specifications."
msgstr "了解每双袜子，查看商品参数。"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:35
msgid "Discover what goes into every pair—and what makes it worth the price."
msgstr "看看每双袜子用了什么，以及它的价值体现在哪里。"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:40
msgid "Explore the socks"
msgstr "查看袜子"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:45
msgid "Our philosophy"
msgstr "我们的理念"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:48
msgid "What goes into a pair"
msgstr "一双袜子的组成"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:48
msgid "Examine material composition, construction, and measurements where records are available."
msgstr "查看已有记录的材料成分、结构工艺与测量数据。"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:49
msgid "Where the evidence comes from"
msgstr "证据来自哪里"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:49
msgid "Manufacturer declarations, our measurements, and third-party tests are clearly distinguished."
msgstr "清楚区分厂家声明、平台实测和第三方检测。"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:50
msgid "What we do not know yet"
msgstr "哪些还未测量"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:50
msgid "Missing results say Not yet measured. We do not fill the gaps with promises."
msgstr "没有测量结果的项目会标注“尚未测量”。我们不会用承诺填补数据空白。"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:62
msgid "Our Philosophy"
msgstr "我们的理念"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:63
msgid "Products should compete on quality, not marketing budgets."
msgstr "商品应以品质竞争，而不是营销预算。"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:64
msgid "At SockSpecs, we believe the value of a product should come from its materials, construction, performance, and durability—not simply the name printed on its packaging."
msgstr "在 SockSpecs，我们相信商品的价值应来自材料、工艺、性能和耐用性，而不只是包装上的品牌名称。"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:65
msgid "That’s why we make product specifications and available quality evidence easy to examine."
msgstr "因此，我们让商品参数和已有的质量证据便于查看。"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:66
msgid "Our goal is simple: better-informed choices, better value, and fair prices."
msgstr "我们的目标很简单：让选择更有依据，让价值更清晰，让价格更合理。"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:67
msgid "Evidence before promises"
msgstr "先看证据，再谈承诺"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:68
msgid "Each published measurement identifies its source and method. A manufacturer declaration is labelled as a declaration. Where measurements are unavailable, we say Not yet measured."
msgstr "每项已发布的测量都注明来源与方法。厂家声明会明确标注为声明。没有测量数据的项目，我们会注明“尚未测量”。"

#: includes/class-brand-pages.php:69
msgid "We do not claim equivalent quality, a longer lifetime, or a particular saving without evidence that supports the claim."
msgstr "没有相应证据，我们不会声称品质相当、寿命更长或能节省特定金额。"

