msgstr "请简短描述在样品上观察到的情况。"

msgid "For visible terry placement, choose Sample observation by us. Record the actual observation date and a short description. Sample color/size and sample count are optional; add them only when useful, such as when variants differ. Blank evidence title and source organization are filled as our own sample observation record; no external URL, laboratory method/version, batch or test-conditions JSON is required. Leave unknowns blank. Do not use this source for composition percentages or performance tests."
